        "title": "Imágenes",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 144764,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>HTML también nos permite añadir imágenes a un HUD de juego.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&#xA;   }&#xA;   img {&#xA;    border: solid gray 10px;&#xA;    margin: 10px;&#xA;    padding: 5px;&#xA;   }&#xA;   h2 {&#xA;    width: 260px;&#xA;    margin: auto;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h2&gt;Level Complete Badge&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img style=&quot;width: 200px;&quot; src=&quot;https://mimo.app/i/rocket.png&quot;&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 144765,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para agregar <strong>sprites</strong> a una interfaz de usuario de un juego, comenzamos con la etiqueta <code>&lt;img&gt;</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;a&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"36\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Player sprite preview\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>&lt;img&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 144766,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Al igual que <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> es una <strong>etiqueta vacía</strong>. Eso significa que no tiene una etiqueta de cierre.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;img&gt;&lt;/img&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Player sprite preview\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>&lt;</code> seguido de <code>img</code> y finalmente <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 144767,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para mostrar un sprite, una etiqueta de imagen necesita el atributo <code>src</code>. <code>src</code> significa fuente.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"source\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"39\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Player sprite preview\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/rocket.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>src</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 144768,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Establecemos el sprite que queremos mostrar con un signo <code>=</code> y la dirección de la imagen entre comillas dobles.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"source\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Player sprite preview\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/rocket.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>src</code> seguido de <code>=</code> y finalmente <code>\"https://mimo.app/i/rocket.png\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 144769,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos usar atributos para cambiar el tamaño de los sprites. Los atributos <code>width</code> y <code>height</code> usan píxeles como la unidad de medida predeterminada.</p><p>Por ejemplo, para establecer el ancho de este sprite a 100px, codifica <code>width = \"100\"</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;100&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"52\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/rocket.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;100&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>width</code> seguido de <code>=</code> y finalmente <code>\"100\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 144770,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Y el atributo <code>height</code> ajusta la <strong>altura</strong> de un sprite.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"59\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/rocket.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;300&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" &gt;\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>height</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 144771,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué hace que <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> sea una etiqueta vacía?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">No tiene etiqueta de cierre</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No tiene atributos</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">No hay <code>/</code> en su etiqueta de apertura</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">No tiene etiqueta de cierre.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 144772,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuántos sprites aparecerán en este HUD del juego?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/rocket.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/star.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">2</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir 2.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 144773,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cómo podemos ajustar la altura de un sprite?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Con el atributo <code>height</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Con la etiqueta <code>&lt;height&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Con el atributo <code>height</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 144774,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué atributo necesitamos establecer para la etiqueta <code>img</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">El atributo <code>src</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">El atributo <code>href</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">El atributo <code>src</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 144775,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Establece el atributo <code>width</code> del sprite a <code>\"200\"</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;width&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"50\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/star.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>width</code> seguido de <code>=</code> y finalmente <code>\"200\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 144776,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Elige la etiqueta correcta para una imagen sprite.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/sword.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/img&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>&lt;img</code> seguido de <code>src=</code> y luego <code>\"https://mimo.app/i/sword.png\"</code>, <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 144777,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa el atributo correcto para establecer la fuente del sprite.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"8\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/rocket.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>src</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 144778,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Código la altura del sprite con <code>height=\"100\"</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"63\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/star.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;100&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;100&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>height=\"100\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
